Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.19 05/30] ASoC: sgtl5000: Fix VAG power-on handling
Date:   Thu, 30 Apr 2020 09:53:00 -0400
Message-Id: <20200430135325.20762-5-sashal@kernel.org>
